      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真正的目标是“天皇赏（秋）”──\n不过，若想在那之前先窥探未来发展，\n“宝冢纪念”也会成为一场至关重要的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34092f6421792af5b5612efd29e87579ccc01800c6acd3c77709ebcb52f1af4a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
