      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“宝冢纪念”上的决战十分热烈。\n比赛中，无声铃鹿展现出令人感受到\n新时代即将到来的惊人速度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ad914ce6b9eacbaf17b0c4710d8a43d3f7b0297cefa1d3f5b4919a48f575a95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
